<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家2階夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―Before I went to sleep, I'd been uneasy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But at some point I was drawn smoothly into a peaceful sleep, and the next thing I knew, the crisp morning sun after the rain was lighting up the room.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Up we go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My first energetic wake-up in a long while.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, still asleep beside me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At times like this, sure enough, my mischievous streak gets a little tickled.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Heh heh heh, now then, what shall I do to her...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Doodling on her face is just too classic...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something more stylish, a smarter prank.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And on top of that, a prank that doesn't hurt <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> too much.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I slipped quietly out of the room and went down to the first floor.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh! Morning, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Looks like we can make it to the station by buggy today!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Good morning, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I flashed <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> a big grin.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> seemed to be cleaning up the yard, where yesterday's rain had scattered the blossoms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And hanging ropes on the cherry tree, spreading out a big cloth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't really tell what the job was for.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> showed no further interest in me, I snuck quietly into the kitchen.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\新村家台所.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Now then, now then... do we have the ingredients...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Melting cheese, wieners, tomato ketchup, sliced bread.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yep, perfect!<PG>
Right there on the spot, I quickly put together some pizza toast.
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\トースター開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm not going to do anything as low as putting something spicy that <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> hates in it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm strictly going to make the most delicious pizza toast I can, just the way <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> likes it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, good morning."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Good morning!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ手.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"My, were you hungry? You could have just told me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, no! This is bait for fishing, sir!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Fishing...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\トースター終わり.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
The toaster oven's cheerful signal announced that the fishing bait was done.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\ピザトースト.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ooh, ooh, ooh! Delicious-looking pizza toast!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"This is the bait...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Fresh, piping-hot pizza toast.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd like to just bite into it myself.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I carried the finished pizza toast up to the second floor ever so carefully.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"What are you going to do with this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Heh heh!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I set the plate of pizza toast down in front of our room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I left the door open just a crack.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Haah, morning..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... what are you doing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One after another, the gallery gathered.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "1000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Then, from inside the room, the sound of someone <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="は">crawling</STYLE> around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Pizza... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">pizza..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE> zombie-like voice drew closer little by little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"No way..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Slowly, the sliding door was opened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\天然ボケにご用心.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花這う影あり.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n900\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n900\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
Appearing there, <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="は">crawling</STYLE> flat like an inchworm, was <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Pizza... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n800\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n800\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">pizza..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n700\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n700\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<BR>
Obviously still half asleep, <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> instinctively caught the signal the pizza was giving off and was drawn toward it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\貪り食う.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Still on all <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ば">fours</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> bit into the pizza toast.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This wasn't eating. It was predation.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Whoa..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Seriously..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Rather than laughing at the bizarre sight, everyone seemed impressed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "WAIT"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\春花這うケチャップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
