{MESON "500"}
With ketchup all over her face, <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> crawled backward to her futon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Good, good. Looks like I'm finally back in form too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
