{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, what were you trying to do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, how do I put it... the goal's not really clear."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
